section.section.about

  div.block
    h1.title About
    div.content
      p.subtitle I make software for the web. The language I'm using the most right now is JavaScript, I've been known to have fun with Python, Java, Go, and many others. I'm currently attending college and working towards a career software development.
      p.subtitle I've carved out this little section of the web, when I decided to roll my own simple sort of content system. the result so far is this. simply put it's a node app that uses webpack to bundle markdown/pug/scss/javascript into their browser supported counterpart.
      p.subtitle I'm about 80% self taught using mostly the internet to read and practice with it's very building blocks, like you're sitting in legos, without instructions, but the lego block's themselves are and provide the instructions for play. I started writing code in like 2008 with myspace and the like. I pushed forward into creating basically a lot of widgets for the web, optimizations for given sites via user-scripts, and now full web applications front to back.

